    "original": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "High-quality 3D CGI render of {argument name=\"character\" default=\"[character]\"} in a charming cartoon style, portrait composition showing head and shoulders. Highly stylized caricature with exaggerated, expressive features that are both playful and humorous. Smooth, polished rendering with clean materials and soft ambient lighting creating gentle shadows. Dynamic camera angle with stylish perspective. Minimalist bright {argument name=\"background color\" default=\"[color]\"} background that makes the character pop and stand out. Professional Pixar-like quality with glossy finish and cheerful mood.",
